      "statement": "Open SWE derives Slack, PR, reviewer, review-scout, review-chat, review-style, and baby-sit lock IDs as URL-namespace UUIDv5 values, while Linear and GitHub issue IDs use SHA-256-derived UUIDs; the reviewer, agent PR, and per-user review-chat keys are deliberately distinct.",
