      "statement": "`create_thread` is the controlled creation path for user-openable LangGraph threads: it requires a nonblank title, stamps the owner's tools-in-sandbox preference, and preserves an existing thread for `if_exists=\"do_nothing\"`; `ensure_titled_thread` respects a `title_locked` human rename.",
