    {
      "id": "claim_083cbdb4c9d640b9b37d492942863428",
      "statement": "Before every model call, queue middleware snapshots queued rows oldest-first, normalizes them into graph messages, and removes the snapshot only after conversion succeeds, leaving messages for retry on a conversion failure and preserving concurrent arrivals for a later call.",
